    <string name="about">About</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">No internet, no accounts, no ads, no tracking. Your data stays on this phone.</string>
    <string name="about_notices">Exercise texts and drawings are original. QR codes by ZXing (Apache 2.0). MET values: Compendium of Physical Activities.</string>
    <string name="privacy_title">How Gym Cat uses health data</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Gym Cat only uses Health Connect if you turn it on.\n\n• Writes: calories burned for each workout, so Gym &amp; Ñam can add them to your day.\n• Reads: your body weight (for calorie estimates and the weight chart) and today\'s protein total.\n\nNothing is sent anywhere: Gym Cat has no internet access. You can turn this off any time in Settings or in Health Connect.</string>
